      "But what if you aren't familiar with Ruby or, for whatever reason, prefer not to install it?\nNo problem!\nThanks to xref:asciidoctorj::index.adoc[AsciidoctorJ] and xref:asciidoctor.js::index.adoc[Asciidoctor.js], you can run the same exact version of Asciidoctor on a Java Virtual Machine (JVM) or JavaScript runtime, respectively.\nThat means you don't need a Ruby runtime installed on your machine after all.\nAsciidoctorJ uses JRuby internally, whereas Asciidoctor.js relies on a Ruby-like runtime written in JavaScript.",
      Some([115, 158, -1, -1, 120, 144, 145, 157]),
      [
        115, 158, -1, -1, 120, 144, 145, 157, -2, 163, 210, -1, -1, 168, 194, 195,
