      "m",
      "Asciidoctor is the successor to AsciiDoc.py, the legacy Python-based processor for the AsciiDoc language.\nIf you're using AsciiDoc.py, follow xref:migrate:asciidoc-py.adoc[] to learn how to upgrade to Asciidoctor.",
