      "m",
      "Asciidoctor provides two interfaces for processing AsciiDoc documents, a xref:cli:index.adoc[CLI] named `asciidoctor` and a xref:api:index.adoc[Ruby API] named `Asciidoctor`.\nThe following table gives you an idea of how to use these interfaces.",
